From: S-BlackDragon <88566750+S-BlackDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:35:27 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] coop: keep the d-pad from the game while the quick-chat
 button is held

With LICHII_COOP on, NPad::RequestPadStateUpdate takes the bits the co-op hook names
(hook/orm_input_mask.h, OrmInputMask::Guest) off the buttons the guest
reads. The hook sets the four d-pad bits while LICHII_ORM_QUICK_CHAT=1
and its button (L by default) is held, so L + d-pad sends a quick
message (oot-remake docs/COMUNICACION.md) without also using the d-pad
item or the ocarina. The hook's own reads (GetNpadButtons, scripted
input included) still see every button. The mask is 0 otherwise, and
nothing changes with LICHII_COOP off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/hid_core/resources/npad/npad.cpp | 10 +++++++++-
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/hid_core/resources/npad/npad.cpp b/src/hid_core/resources/npad/npad.cpp
index d7fdb2a..aeb81e0 100644
--- a/src/hid_core/resources/npad/npad.cpp
+++ b/src/hid_core/resources/npad/npad.cpp
@@ -25,6 +25,9 @@
 #include "hid_core/resources/npad/npad.h"
 #include "hid_core/resources/npad/npad_vibration.h"
 #include "hid_core/resources/shared_memory_format.h"
+#ifdef LICHII_COOP
+#include "orm_input_mask.h"
+#endif
 
 namespace Service::HID {
 
@@ -446,7 +449,12 @@ void NPad::RequestPadStateUpdate(Kernel::KernelCore& kernel, u64 aruid, Core::HI
 
     auto& pad_entry = controller.npad_pad_state;
     auto& trigger_entry = controller.npad_trigger_state;
-    const auto button_state = controller.device->GetNpadButtons();
+    auto button_state = controller.device->GetNpadButtons();
+#ifdef LICHII_COOP
+    // ORM quick messages: while their button is held the d-pad is the co-op
+    // hook's, not the game's (hook/orm_input_mask.h).
+    button_state.raw &= ~static_cast<Core::HID::NpadButton>(OrmInputMask::Guest());
+#endif
     const auto stick_state = controller.device->GetSticks();
 
     using btn = Core::HID::NpadButton;
